    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Koro-san just keeps hitting home runs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Koro-san loves baseball, so she invited all the Hololive Gamers to play baseball. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But it seems everyone wants to be the pitcher. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The listeners will be in charge of defense, and Koro-san will just hit the ball to his heart's content!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732150/extras/9f3669bda1a869dcd0aa940727530ea0.avif?t=1753678730\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Koro-san's has to do is hit home runs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smack down the magic pitches thrown by the other Gamers and their fans!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep swinging until you reach the required number of home runs for each stage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear all the stages, and someone unexpected might show up...!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the bread you earn in each stage to power up Korosan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep training to become a true home run slugger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RTA Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An RTA (Real-Time Attack) mode is included with time tracking!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even the time spent powering up feels like a waste!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push for the fastest clear time possible!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keyboard Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D keys / Arrow keys<br>\u30fbMove the cursor<br>\u30fbMove the character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter key / Space key<br>\u30fbConfirm<br>\u30fbHold to ready the bat, release to swing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC key<br>\u30fbCancel<br>\u30fbOpen the menu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Switching from Fullscreen to Windowed Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alt key + Enter key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: Steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
